2026-08-30  XferCore Development Team

	Release XferCore 1.6.4
	
	* Version bump from 1.6.3 to 1.6.4
	* Fixed uTP connection_id scheme to comply with BEP 29 / libtorrent:
	  initiator/responder send/recv ids were swapped, so uTP handshakes
	  with standard clients always failed and fell back to TCP
	* Added SYN-retransmit routing and a standalone uTP protocol self-test
	* General improvements and bug fixes

---

2026-06-18  FluxCore Development Team

	Release FluxCore 1.2.2
	
	* Version bump from 1.2.1 to 1.2.2
	* General improvements and bug fixes
	* Performance optimizations for download engine
	* Enhanced stability and reliability

